@startuml
title Eureka Music - Container
actor User
rectangle "Desktop Client" {
  component "PySide2 UI" as UI
  database "SQLite\nlibrary.db" as SQLite
  folder "Local Tracks" as LocalFiles
}
rectangle "Backend" {
  component "FastAPI" as API
  database "PostgreSQL" as PG
  folder "Audio Filesystem" as Audio
}

User --> UI
UI --> API : REST
UI --> SQLite : local metadata/playlists
UI --> LocalFiles : local playback
API --> PG : catalog metadata
API --> Audio : upload/download files
@enduml
